N5008 [dcl.constexpr]/6 (a constexpr static member array is const),
[dcl.init.ref] (a reference-to-array parameter denotes the whole array in the
constexpr evaluator), [conv.integral] (a converted scalar argument is folded
before it is bound).  The libc++ <tuple> __find_exactly_one_checked shape used
by std::variant's holds_alternative/get<T>.
